sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Local IPC sending and child task completion differ
  accDescr: The child reports ready, the parent sends task-1, and send returns a local flow-control result. A later child message reports task-1 total 5. Parent and child are separate processes with deserialized data.
participant P as Parent process
  participant C as Child process
  Note over P,C: send Boolean: local flow control<br/>not child acknowledgment
  C-->>P: ready message
  P->>C: send job task-1
  C->>C: receive and compute total
  C-->>P: result task-1: total 5
  P->>P: validate matching result
